<h1 class="oneline">Dolly Parton &amp; the Roots of Country Music</h1>
</div>
<div id="main_menu_fixed">
<div id="main_body">
<div id="main_nav1">
<a href="dollyparton-home.html">Home</a> | <a href="dollyparton-photos.html">Photos</a> | <strong>Locust Ridge, TN</strong> | <a href="dollyparton-learnmore.html">Learn More</a> | <a href="dollyparton-copyright.html">Restrictions</a> | <a href="dollyparton-credits.html">Acknowledgments</a>
